  "spoken_script": "LEDABER.\nPARLARE.\nANI MEDABER IVRIT KTSAT.\n\nBA-HOVE:\nMEDABER.\nMEDABERET.\nMEDABRIM.\nMEDABROT.\n\nBE-AVAR:\nDIBARTI.\nDIBARTA.\nDIBART.\nDIBER.\nDIBRA.\nDIBARNU.\nDIBARTEM.\nDIBARTEN.\nDIBRU.\n\nBE-ATID:\nADABER.\nTEDABER.\nTEDABRI.\nYEDABER.\nTEDABER.\nNEDABER.\nTEDABRU.\nYEDABRU.",
